s=s[:start]+"""<section class="sofia-expect" aria-labelledby="sofia-expect-title"><p class="kicker">One step at a time</p><h2 id="sofia-expect-title">What speaking with Sofia is designed to feel like</h2><p class="expect-intro">When AI calling is connected, this is the conversation you can expect. The AI call button on this page is not connected yet; you can use the separate number above to call Phillips intake directly.</p><ol class="expect-steps"><li><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>A clear introduction</h3><p>Sofia introduces herself as AI, explains that the call is recorded, and lets you decide whether to continue. She is not an attorney. You can take a break or end the conversation at any time.</p></li><li><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>A few basics, at your pace</h3><p>One question at a time: Uber or Lyft, the year and state, whether unwanted physical sexual contact occurred, and whether a lawyer handles or previously handled the matter. She also asks about the emailed ride receipt, whether you told someone, and information the firm may need to review. No graphic account is needed. It is okay to say “I am not ready to answer.”</p></li><li><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Your permission before a next step</h3><p>If your answers appear to fit the campaign, Sofia asks permission to save a brief, non-graphic summary and try a connection to intake. An uncertain answer is not treated as a completed qualification. If the details cannot be saved or a connection fails, she says so; a callback is not automatically booked.</p></li><li><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>A person reviews the matter</h3><p>A person at Phillips Law Group reviews any evidence and discusses possible next steps. AI screening does not decide legal eligibility, accept a case, or send a retainer. Representation requires the firm’s acceptance and a separate agreement.</p></li></ol></section><div class="handoff"><h2>There is a person behind the next decision.</h2><p>You choose what to share. The Phillips team decides whether it can review a matter and explains any next steps. A call or pre-check does not create an attorney-client relationship.</p><img src="/phillips/ri/assets/phillips-rideshare/team.webp" alt="The Phillips Law Group team" width="800" height="337" loading="lazy"></div>"""+s[end:]
s=s.replace('<footer class="foot"><div class="wrap">','<footer class="foot"><div class="wrap">'+legal.replace('under-form-legal','footer-disclaimer'))
s=s.replace('</head>',"""<style>.sofia-expect{text-align:left;margin:64px auto 32px;max-width:960px}.sofia-expect>h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,36px);line-height:1.2;margin:8px 0 16px}.expect-intro{max-width:760px;line-height:1.65;color:#c8cbd0}.talk .sofia-expect>.kicker{color:#ee8d8d}.expect-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0}.expect-steps li{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e1da;border-radius:16px;padding:24px}.step-number{display:inline-block;color:#a52426;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em}.expect-steps h3{color:#202124;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;margin:10px 0}.expect-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;color:#565c63}.talk .handoff{max-width:800px;margin:40px auto}.talk .footer-disclaimer{color:#d0d2d6;padding:0 0 24px;margin:0 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d5cf;text-align:left}.talk .footer-disclaimer .firm-disclaimer{position:static;background:transparent;padding:0;border:0;color:inherit;font:16px/1.5 'Times New Roman',Times,serif}@media(max-width:600px){.expect-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.expect-steps li{padding:20px}.sofia-expect{margin-top:44px}}</style></head>""")
